#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1074
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <command>su</command>, <command>sudo</command> or <command>ssh</command> "
"for running privileged commands. For remote Debian APT <command>ssh</command> "
"is always used."
msgstr ""
"ប្រើ <command>su</command>, <command>sudo</command> ឬ <command>ssh</command> "
"សម្រាប់​រត់​ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​ដែល​មាន​​សិទ្ធិ ។ សម្រាប់ Debian APT ពី​ចម្ងាយ <command>ssh</command> ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​ជានិច្ច ។"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1080
#, no-c-format
msgid "Verify file list"
msgstr "បញ្ជាក់​បញ្ជី​ឯកសារ"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1081
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If set the list of files in the package is checked to see if they are actually "
